text: "抛下这句话，她离开了疗养院。临别的时候，又瞪了我一次。",
voice: None,
),
),
(
cmd: label,
args: (
name: "block_01032",
),
),
(
cmd: wait,
args: (
time_ms: 400,
),
),
(
cmd: dialogue,
args: (
speaker: None,
text: "虽然偶尔也会有人说类似的话，但被叮嘱到这份儿上还是头一次。",
voice: None,
),
),
(
cmd: label,
args: (
name: "block_01033",
),
),
(
cmd: wait,
args: (
time_ms: 400,
),
),
(
cmd: dialogue,
args: (
speaker: None,
