),
),
(
cmd: wait,
args: (
time_ms: 400,
),
),
(
cmd: dialogue,
args: (
speaker: None,
text: "……到现在，我终于才明白。以医生为目标，在成为医生后的现在才能明白的一些事情。",
voice: None,
),
),
(
cmd: label,
args: (
name: "block_02939",
),
),
(
cmd: wait,
args: (
time_ms: 400,
),
),
(
cmd: dialogue,
args: (
speaker: None,
text: "曾经在养老院体会到的无力感，一直希望能做些什么的孩提时代。",
voice: None,
),
),
(
cmd: label,
args: (
name: "block_02940",
),
),
(
cmd: wait,
args: (
time_ms: 400,
),
),
(
cmd: dialogue,
args: (
speaker: None,
text: "但是，即便如此，我也不是为了养老院才当上医生的吧。",
voice: None,
),
),
(
cmd: label,
args: (
name: "block_02941",
),
),
(
cmd: wait,
args: (
time_ms: 400,
),
),
(
cmd: dialogue,
args: (
speaker: None,
text: "一开始，是为了成为那家伙的梦想而被拜托成为了医生……那也是刚开始的1年。",
